":null,"call_locator":"ec9575da3d35a47cdaa3de5f06d2f6ec98322d817911d73413b693c4c3e017e6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a6ad5d6bc9d03bb3b529305c46534d8d3ef684d1c7fcc20c4dac586f13b7e03","logical_entry_identity":"ed097c3998f870c91d400097c619c84b5ce2c735895b44fbf3ffd992c9e33ac5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You hit your target, doing %d%% damage. If your attack connects, the target is crippled for %d turns, losing %d%% melee, spellcasting and mind speed.\n\t\tThe chance to land the status improves with Accuracy, and the status power improves with Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你打击你的目标，造成 %d%% 伤害。如果你击中了目标，目标会被残废 %d 回合，降低 %d%% 战斗，法术和精神速度。\n\t\t附加异常状态的几率受命中值提升，异常状态效果受灵巧值提升。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8109ccb7724998f4c9f5b09d669de3be5266200832489af61c530c2684bb6616","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a6c1421e078ef314b74bdd4c1a963e75fbd85a68f3ad84f95859e3402a0a439","logical_entry_identity":"859303ab67339d92fecddef5591a0943eb4c382b9e4e160fc42a5f5917d6bec0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GREY#Removing [%s] %s at (%s, %s)","source_tag":"log","target":"#GREY#移除 [%s] %s 位于 (%s, %s)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be4f5f9c262305dcee15555f026e02f82ce25abdcfd4c17e5aa609d81fecd9ce","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a723762b2f95eca67717d8596580014b44bbabed2df15665409fa2502f9ae5c","logical_entry_identity":"1f40f93beae33196ee240376358b636d25df75d902a623eec959760a0f1548b9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Strength#LAST#\nStrength defines your character's ability to apply physical force. It increases Physical Power, damage done with heavy weapons, Physical Save, and carrying capacity.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#力量#LAST#\n力量属性影响你的角色的物理能力，提升力量可以提高物理强度，提高使用重型武器造成的伤害，提高物理豁免，同时提高你的负重量。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"377f0ef891830b44bad242e3d6a2c1ffdd48a93bc6aa487bac55d60470941e19","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a7a5fde948c1a428d39642311be0e0ac128e18f41029ec3f46c7d70dfc34c08","logical_entry_identity":"6301a219cda11792d87f6ee483987a0f23c161aacd870a28f44dfad83438c2a8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Puts targets in a radius %d cone into a nightmarish sleep for %d turns, rendering them unable to act.  Every %d points of damage the target suffers will reduce the effect duration by one turn.\n\t\tEach turn, they'll suffer %0.2f darkness damage.  This damage will not reduce the duration of the effect.\n\t\tWhen Nightmare ends, the target will suffer from Insomnia for a number of turns equal to the amount of time it was asleep (up to ten turns max), granting it %d%% sleep immunity for each turn of the Insomnia effect.\n\t\tThe damage threshold and darkness damage will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使 %d 码锥形范围内的目标进入持续 %d 回合的噩梦，令其无法行动。目标每承受 %d 点伤害减少一回合状态持续时间。\n\t\t每回合目标会受到 %0.2f 暗影伤害。此伤害不会减少噩梦的状态持续时间。\n\t\t当梦魇结束时，目标会饱受失眠的痛苦，持续回合等于已睡眠的回合数（但最多 10 回合），失眠状态的每一个剩余回合数会让目标获得 %d%% 睡眠免疫。\n\t\t伤害临界点和暗影伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20dd9b9fbd62ecc56bcc6cc598aa77f9952096900f5479613f5cdd9f76cdaa89","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a7bca5e6721698e996147c0af9746fc688824c94335d2aed14c3295dc89161f","logical_entry_identity":"15dac7905306eed9b975907393357abbb7b7e9106bd80acd1e5df462a50ec497","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# Reset base filter","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# 重设基础筛选器"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"590d9f1ce9efdbf92286c030bce0aa410fcfab3da5a0bf09d9d0a258cbee6f5a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4a7c30e7cc713db01d18e8bc6ee72f313a2d97701f1c22edf421df525c9dc5f9","logical_entry_identity":"ecdad286534f83b5c7c65d2748f79aa30e70a1ef14cdefb1b26732e34ab8d7d6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Most weapons are wielded in the main hand.","source_tag":"_t","target":"大部分武器使用主手抓握。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d277af046ee3f60f8e2e7e91d0da19dda986f7fb2d97cc3529fbccc8b799d7b","component":"tome","entry_r